93
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:58,600
And even further north than that, there was a city with a solid stone wall,

94
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:01,600
handily keeping the nearby criminals at arm's length.

95
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:09,600
The only entrance from the junkyard below is called the Great Gate.

96
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:13,600
Twice a day, mountains of discarded trash from all over the country

97
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,600
are carried through it and dumped into Grey Terminal.

98
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,600
Here it comes!

99
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,600
Let's go!

100
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:22,600
Treasure hunting time!

101
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:26,100
From time to time, residents of Grey Terminal will enter the city

102
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:29,100
to sell what they call recycled goods.

103
00:07:34,100 --> 00:07:35,100
Hey, wait!

104
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:37,100
What's in that package?

105
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:41,100
Crocodile skin.

106
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:42,100
Want it?

107
00:07:42,100 --> 00:07:43,100
What?

108
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:46,600
Go ahead!

109
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,600
Beyond the Great Gate is a boulevard

110
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:54,600
through which everyone entering the city must pass.

111
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,100
It leads to Edge Town.

112
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:57,100
It leads to Edge Town.

113
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:05,100
Edge Town, populated by thugs and criminals,

114
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:08,100
