Gotta pick your targets more carefully.

122
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:37,160
You might get more than you bargained for.

123
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:40,080
Oh, damn it, not them!

124
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:41,580
Look out!

125
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,740
No mercy!

126
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:43,740
All right!

127
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:05,400
In the middle of the city, another stone wall reaches to the skies.

128
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:12,580
This one encloses Hightown, which separates those with noble blood from their lesser neighbors.

129
00:09:15,260 --> 00:09:18,100
This is the shining jewel of the Goa kingdom.

130
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:24,260
Said to be the most beautiful country in all of the East Blue, not a hint of trash can be found on its streets.

131
00:09:24,260 --> 00:09:29,340
Windmill Village can make no such claim.

132
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:36,600
And although it's technically a part of the Goa kingdom, the fact is often swept under the rug by its more wealthy inhabitants.

133
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:43,400
I told you they'd love that crocodile skin.

134
