The VIP room, please.

147
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:25,200
But that mark, it can't be.

148
00:10:25,820 --> 00:10:27,520
Please excuse my impertinence, sir.

149
00:10:27,740 --> 00:10:30,880
We would be honored to have a noble such as yourself grace our establishment.

150
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:33,240
Give me but a moment and I'll gladly prepare a room.

151
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:37,760
That's pretty handy.

152
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,480
Where did you get that thing?

153
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,780
Oh, uh...

154
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,020
Yeah, it's weird.

155
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,400
