156
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:51,180
Three bowls of ramen.

157
00:10:51,580 --> 00:10:52,900
Thank you for waiting.

158
00:10:53,260 --> 00:10:54,060
Enjoy your meal.

159
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,920
So this is ramen, huh?

160
00:10:58,160 --> 00:10:59,960
Whoa, looks good.

161
00:11:01,740 --> 00:11:03,160
Well, eat it already.

162
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:10,580
